---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const title = 'Proof to Partner | Evidence-first business introductions';
const description = 'Bring a genuine commercial requirement into focus. Proof to Partner researches context and explores relevant B2B introductions without promising outcomes.';
---
<SiteLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/">
<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-paper"><div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 -z-10 hidden w-[52%] decor-grid lg:block"></div><div class="container-shell grid items-center gap-12 py-16 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.04fr_.96fr] lg:gap-14 lg:py-28">
<div><p class="eyebrow">Commercial introductions, approached with evidence</p><h1 class="display-heading mt-6 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-6xl lg:text-[4.45rem]">The right conversation starts with a <span class="text-brand">real requirement.</span></h1><p class="prose-copy mt-7 max-w-xl text-lg">Business opportunities can stall when needs are vague, the right counterpart is hard to identify, or introductions happen before the facts are clear. We start by understanding the requirement—then explore whether a relevant connection makes sense.</p><div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><a class="btn-primary" href="/contact/?type=buyer">Discuss a requirement <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="btn-secondary" href="/how-it-works/">See how it works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-xs font-medium text-muted"><span>● Requirement-led</span><span>● Evidence-informed</span><span>● No guaranteed outcomes</span></div></div>
<div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-xl"><div class="absolute -right-3 -top-4 size-24 rounded-full bg-[#e1eee8] blur-2xl"></div><div class="relative rounded-[1.8rem] border border-[#dbe5e0] bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_24px_80px_-35px_rgba(19,40,59,0.24)] sm:p-7"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line pb-5"><div><p class="text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.17em] text-brand-deep">A considered process</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">From need to next step</h2></div><div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-mint text-xl text-brand-deep" aria-hidden="true">↗</div></div><div class="mt-6 space-y-3"><div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper p-4"><div class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink text-sm font-bold text-white">01</div><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Define the requirement</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Scope, constraints, timing and decision criteria.</p></div></div><div class="flex justify-center text-brand" aria-hidden="true">↓</div><div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-line bg-white p-4"><div class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-mint text-sm font-bold text-brand-deep">02</div><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Research relevant context</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Look for potential counterparties that fit the stated need.</p></div></div><div class="flex justify-center text-brand" aria-hidden="true">↓</div><div class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#b7d6ca] bg-[#f1f8f4] p-4"><div class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-brand text-sm font-bold text-white">03</div><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Explore an introduction</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Where fit, interest and permission are established.</p></div></div></div><p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-muted">Illustrative process, not a claim of completed transactions or guaranteed matches.</p></div><div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-line bg-[#f0efe9] px-5 py-4"><div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-muted">The starting point</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold">A clear need beats a vague lead.</p></div><span class="text-2xl text-brand" aria-hidden="true">◎</span></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="border-y border-line bg-white"><div class="container-shell grid gap-8 py-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10"><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">For businesses buying</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Describe a defined need, the context around it and what a suitable supplier would need to provide.</p><a class="mt-3 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-brand-deep underline underline-offset-4" href="/for-buyers/">For buyers →</a></div><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">For capable suppliers</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Explain what you do, where you operate, the work you are equipped for and the conditions that make a fit.</p><a class="mt-3 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-brand-deep underline underline-offset-4" href="/for-suppliers/">For suppliers →</a></div><div><p class="text-sm font-semibold">For early conversations</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">You do not need a polished brief. A clear description of the challenge is enough to begin.</p><a class="mt-3 inline-flex text-sm font-semibold text-brand-deep underline underline-offset-4" href="/contact/">Get in touch →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section-space"><div class="container-shell grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-20"><div><p class="eyebrow">The approach</p><h2 class="display-heading mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">Connection is useful only when the context is right.</h2><p class="prose-copy mt-6">Proof to Partner is being built around a simple principle: understand the buyer-side requirement, test whether a potential match is relevant, and respect each party's time and consent before facilitating an introduction.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-brand-deep underline decoration-[#9cbeb4] underline-offset-4" href="/about/">Learn about our philosophy <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><article class="card-border p-6 sm:p-7"><div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-mint text-xl text-brand-deep" aria-hidden="true">⌁</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Start with specificity</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">A meaningful requirement includes scope, location, timing and the criteria that matter—not just an industry label.</p></article><article class="card-border p-6 sm:p-7"><div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-sand text-xl text-ink" aria-hidden="true">◷</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Do the context work</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">Research can help assess relevance, but information is checked in context and uncertainty is not presented as fact.</p></article><article class="card-border p-6 sm:p-7"><div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-sand text-xl text-ink" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Respect both sides</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">An introduction is explored only when it makes sense to both parties and appropriate permission has been obtained.</p></article><article class="card-border p-6 sm:p-7"><div class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-mint text-xl text-brand-deep" aria-hidden="true">◇</div><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Keep outcomes honest</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-muted">A conversation can establish fit—or show that the fit is not there. No enquiry guarantees a match, deal or timeline.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="bg-ink py-16 text-white sm:py-20"><div class="container-shell grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]"><div><p class="eyebrow !text-[#a4d4c7]">Begin with a conversation</p><h2 class="display-heading mt-5 max-w-2xl text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">Bring the requirement. We can work through the context.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-white/70">Tell us what you are trying to source, supply or understand. We will review the information and consider whether there is a sensible next step.</p></div><a class="btn-primary !border-[#a4d4c7] !bg-[#a4d4c7] !text-ink hover:!bg-[#c3e5dc]" href="/contact/">Start an enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</SiteLayout>